     {
      "claim_id": "claim_3",
      "text": "## 「宰予昼寝」章原文",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_4",
      "text": "> 宰予昼寝，子曰：“朽木不可雕也，粪土之墙不可圬也，于予与何诛",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_5",
      "text": "”子曰：“始吾于人也，听其言而信其行",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_6",
      "text": "今吾于人也，听其言而观其行",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_7",
      "text": "**出处标注：**【《论语》·公冶长篇】（原文第 10 段，全篇第五则涉及宰予的内容）",
      "epistemic_type": "SOURCE_FACT",
      "role": "TEXTUAL_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [
       "ev_31"
      ],
      "direct_evidence": true
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_8",
      "text": "### 若干需要说明的核验点",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_9",
      "text": "1. **「宰予昼寝」四字本身是记事文字**，是编撰者（孔子弟子及再传弟子）对这一事件情境的叙述，而非孔子所言",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_10",
      "text": "真正的**孔子原话**是上面引号内的两段：",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_11",
      "text": "- 第一段批评（「朽木不可雕也……」）",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_12",
      "text": "- 第二段自省与经验总结（「始吾于人也……」）",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_13",
      "text": "两段均以「子曰」开头，说明记录者视它们为孔子两次相继的发言",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_14",
      "text": "2. **「圬」字版本问题**：此章「粪土之墙不可**圬**也」，通行本（如朱熹《论语集注》）或作「**杇**」（wū，涂抹粉刷之义）",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_15",
      "text": "我在此核验到的版本写作「圬」，意义相同",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_16",
      "text": "若你手头版本作「杇」，两者为同一字之异体，并不影响文义",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_17",
      "text": "3. **「于予与何诛」的断句**：有学者读为「于予与，何诛」（对宰予这个人，还有什么好责备的），也有人径读「于予与何诛」",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_18",
      "text": "两种读法皆通，文意均为孔子对宰予昼寝表达近乎失望的叹喟",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_19",
      "text": "此处的「与」字在通行注本中多读去声",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_20",
      "text": "4. **文义提示**：此章并不仅是对「昼寝」这一行为的表面责备",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_21",
      "text": "孔子由「听其言而信其行」转为「听其言而观其行」，实为一场关于**「言」与「行」关系**的方法论转折——孔子以此教训（连同公冶长篇中其他论弟子之章）提醒后世：判断一个人，不能止于其言辞，更要察其行为",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "LATER_CRITICISM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_22",
      "text": "这与《论语》中「先行其言而后从之」「讷于言而敏于行」等一贯主张彼此呼应",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     },
     {
      "claim_id": "claim_23",
      "text": "如你需要，我可以进一步核验此章在各注本（朱熹《集注》、皇侃《义疏》等）中的异文与注释差异",
      "epistemic_type": "UNKNOWN",
      "role": "INTERPRETIVE_CLAIM",
      "evidence_ids": [],
      "direct_evidence": false
     }
